| 5           | 1410             |
| 6           | 627              |
| 7           | 748              |
| 8           | 1540             |
| 9           | 1292             |
| 10          | 1138             |

Genres (from products.csv):

| item_name   | item_value | resource_requirement |
|-------------|------------|---------------------|
| Racing      | 28         | 393                 |
| Sports      | 69         | 195                 |
| Action      | 20         | 192                 |
| Adventure   | 62         | 155                 |
| RPG         | 58         | 500                 |
| Shooter     | 11         | 156                 |
